WEBVTT

00:11:56.254 --> 00:12:00.643
So I'll tell you now what I didn't have
the guts to tell my friends at the time.

00:12:01.483 --> 00:12:03.737
No, you're not safe --

00:12:04.273 --> 00:12:05.988
not just because of North Korea.

00:12:06.798 --> 00:12:09.616
But there is something
you can do about it.

00:12:11.266 --> 00:12:14.743
Demand that your elected representatives

00:12:14.767 --> 00:12:17.774
can give you answers to your questions,

00:12:17.798 --> 00:12:20.465
and answers that you can live with

00:12:20.489 --> 00:12:23.099
and that billions of others
can live with too.

00:12:24.644 --> 00:12:25.925
And if they can't,

00:12:25.949 --> 00:12:28.186
stay on them until they can.

00:12:29.284 --> 00:12:31.042
And if that doesn't work,